Temper, temper But you always were so
easy to manipulate The perfect toy Oh,

251
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,237
I meant to say tool.

252
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:35,197
And you thought building the
control spires was your idea.

253
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:36,868
What are you talking about?

254
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:38,509
I can't take this anymore.

255
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,249
Hello, Ichijoji residence.

256
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,197
I'm sorry, Ken's busy right now.

257
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:47,137
Would you please hang up and
try your call again later?

258
00:12:47,220 --> 00:12:49,160
Are you the operator?

259
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:51,600
No, I'm the Digimon.

260
00:12:51,940 --> 00:12:53,040
